<section class="fcx-band"><div class="fcx-wrap"><div class="fcx-center"><h2>What Are Jet Fans?</h2></div><p class="fcx-lead">Jet fans are compact ventilation systems that create a high-velocity air movement to move surrounding air through an enclosed area. They can push air through open areas without requiring a complete ductwork system, making them useful for basement car parks and tunnel ventilation.</p><p class="fcx-lead">The main purpose of Jet Fans is to maintain air circulation and help with smoke clearance. Depending on the system design, these fans can be used for everyday ventilation as well as emergency smoke extraction.</p><div class="fcx-cards fcx-cards--2"><div class="fcx-card"><span class="fcx-ico"><i class="fas fa-fan"></i></span><h3>Induced Jet Fans</h3><p>Induced jet fans draw surrounding air and accelerate it through an aerodynamic bell-mouth inducer nozzle. This design helps create an effective air movement pattern within large enclosed areas.</p><p>The Delhi range includes jet fans in 315 mm, 355 mm, and 400 mm diameters, with a capacity up to 11,000 CMH. These fans are available with dual-speed operation and high-temperature motors rated Class H at 300°C/200°C for two hours.</p></div><div class="fcx-card"><span class="fcx-ico"><i class="fas fa-fan"></i></span><h3>Impulse Jet Fans</h3><p>Impulse jet fans generate high-velocity air jets in a particular direction. They are designed for controlled airflow movement and are especially useful in basement parking areas and other confined spaces.</p><p>The available models include FAIJF 50, FAIJF 56, and FAIJF 63. The product range is designed with compact construction, high airflow capacity, extended throw distance, and low-noise operation.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="fcx-band fcx-band--alt"><div class="fcx-wrap"><h2>Key Features of Jet Fans</h2><p>Industrial Jet Fans may be configured with features suited to different ventilation and smoke control requirements. Important features include:</p><ul class="fcx-checks"><li>Compact and space-saving design</li><li>High Airflow Capacity</li><li>Long throw distance</li><li>Dual-speed operation for selected models</li><li>Low-noise operation</li><li>Integrated acoustic silencers</li><li>High-temperature-rated motors</li><li>IP55 motor protection</li><li>Class H insulation</li><li>Suitable for basement and tunnel ventilation</li><li>Simple maintenance requirements</li></ul><p>The impulse jet fan range is especially appropriate for low-ceiling car parks where space may be limited. The current Delhi product page also specifies totally enclosed, ventilated, high-temperature-rated motors for smoke exhaust applications.</p></div></section><section class="fcx-band"><div class="fcx-wrap"><h2>Technical Specifications</h2><div class="fcx-spec"><table class="fcx-table"><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Fan Type</th><td>Induced Jet Fans &amp; Impulse Jet Fans</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Induced Fan Diameter</th><td>315 mm, 355 mm &amp; 400 mm</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Induced Fan Capacity</th><td>Up to 11,000 CMH</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Fan Speed</th><td>Dual Speed</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Motor</th><td>Class H, 300°C/200°C for 2 Hours</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Impulse Models</th><td>FAIJF 50, FAIJF 56, FAIJF 63</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Motor Protection</th><td>IP55</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Motor Insulation</th><td>Class H</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Main Applications</th><td>Car Parks, Tunnels &amp; Smoke Control</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="fcx-note"><span class="fcx-ico"><i class="fas fa-sliders"></i></span><div><p>The actual fan selection depends on the specified airflow, pressure, throw distance, temperature conditions, and design of the installation area.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="fcx-band fcx-band--alt"><div class="fcx-wrap"><div class="fcx-center"><h2>Applications of Jet Fans</h2></div><p class="fcx-lead"><b>Jet Fans in Delhi</b> are used across commercial, industrial, infrastructure, and building ventilation projects. Some common applications include:</p><div class="fcx-cards fcx-cards--4"><div class="fcx-card"><span class="fcx-ico"><i class="fas fa-square-parking"></i></span><h3>Basement Car Parks</h3><p>Basement parking areas may have limited natural ventilation. Jet fans help move air through the parking area and support the removal of unwanted air and smoke.</p></div><div class="fcx-card"><span class="fcx-ico"><i class="fas fa-road"></i></span><h3>Tunnel Ventilation</h3><p>Tunnels require planned airflow to maintain suitable ventilation conditions. Jet fans can create directional air movement without requiring large ductwork throughout the tunnel.</p></div><div class="fcx-card"><span class="fcx-ico"><i class="fas fa-fire"></i></span><h3>Smoke Control Systems</h3><p>During a fire emergency, smoke needs to be managed and directed towards designated extraction points. High-temperature jet fan systems can form part of a smoke management strategy.</p></div><div class="fcx-card"><span class="fcx-ico"><i class="fas fa-building"></i></span><h3>Commercial Buildings</h3><p>Large commercial developments, malls, hospitals, and other enclosed buildings may also require mechanical ventilation in basement and service areas. Jet fans may be incorporated into these ventilation systems according to project requirements.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="fcx-band"><div class="fcx-wrap"><div class="fcx-duo"><div class="fcx-panel"><span class="fcx-ico"><i class="fas fa-fan"></i></span><h2>Benefits of Jet Fans</h2><p>One of the primary benefits of jet fans is their ability to move air through open spaces without depending on a complete duct network. This can offer more flexibility when planning ventilation for large enclosed areas.</p><p>Their compact design also makes them suitable for areas where the ceiling height is limited. High airflow and extended throw distance can help distribute air over large areas.</p><p>For smoke management applications, high-temperature motor options offer an appropriate configuration for systems designed to handle elevated temperatures. The proper fan and control arrangement should always be selected according to the whole ventilation and fire-safety design.</p></div><div class="fcx-panel"><span class="fcx-ico"><i class="fas fa-fan"></i></span><h2>Jet Fans Suppliers in Delhi</h2><p>Selecting appropriate <b>Jet Fans Suppliers in Delhi</b> is essential because jet fan performance depends on proper sizing and positioning. Factors such as airflow, static pressure, throw distance, ceiling height, parking design, tunnel dimensions, and smoke extraction requirements must be considered.</p><p>For Delhi projects, the current product data state that fans are selected according to the required airflow, static pressure, and site conditions. Technical sizing and data can be supplied before ordering, while completed equipment can be dispatched to Delhi and other parts of India.</p></div><div class="fcx-panel" style="grid-column:1/-1"><span class="fcx-ico"><i class="fas fa-industry"></i></span><h2>Jet Fans Manufacturer in India</h2><p>A reliable <b>Jet Fans Manufacturer in India</b> needs to be able to provide equipment for both everyday ventilation and smoke control requirements. Different fan types, motor arrangements, temperature ratings, and performance levels can be required depending on the project.</p><p>For large basement and tunnel projects, proper fan positioning is also essential. The number of fans, direction of airflow, spacing, and interaction with smoke extraction points must be considered during system planning.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="fcx-band fcx-band--alt"><div class="fcx-wrap"><h2>How to Choose the Right Jet Fan?</h2><p>Before selecting a jet fan, consider the following factors:</p><ul class="fcx-checks fcx-checks--long"><li><b>Application:</b> Identify whether the fan is needed for car park ventilation, tunnel ventilation, or smoke control.</li><li><b>Airflow:</b> Determine the required airflow for the complete space.</li><li><b>Throw distance:</b> Check how far the air jet needs to travel.</li><li><b>Temperature:</b> For smoke control, select the suitable high-temperature configuration.</li><li><b>Space:</b> Check the available ceiling height and installation area.</li><li><b>Noise:</b> Consider acoustic requirements for commercial and residential environments.</li><li><b>Fan positioning:</b> Plan the location and direction of each fan according to the ventilation design.</li></ul><p>Correct selection helps the ventilation system to achieve the required air movement while supporting efficient operation.</p></div></section><section class="fcx-band"><div class="fcx-wrap"><div class="fcx-center"><h2>FAQs</h2></div><div class="fcx-faq"><details><summary>What are jet fans used for?</summary><p>Jet fans are mainly used for ventilation and smoke management in enclosed areas such as basement car parks, tunnels, and other confined areas.</p></details><details><summary>What is the capacity of the induced jet fans?</summary><p>The induced jet fan range listed for Delhi has a capacity of up to 11,000 CMH, with 315 mm, 355 mm, and 400 mm diameter options.</p></details><details><summary>What types of jet fans are available?</summary><p>The Delhi range includes Induced Jet Fans and Impulse Jet Fans, each designed for particular airflow and ventilation requirements.</p></details><details><summary>Are jet fans appropriate for smoke control?</summary><p>Yes. Jet fans can form part of smoke control systems in basement car parks and tunnels. High-temperature-rated motor configurations are available for appropriate applications.</p></details><details><summary>Which jet fan is suitable for a basement car park?</summary><p>The selection depends on the size and design of the parking area, required airflow, throw distance, ceiling height, and smoke-control design. Impulse jet fans are mainly listed as suitable for low-ceiling car parks.</p></details></div><div class="fcx-center" style="margin-top:26px"><a href="product.php" class="btn-cyber btn-cyber--primary fcx-btn" title="Fan Air India Products">Learn More <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></a></div></div></section><section class="fcx-band"><div class="fcx-wrap"><div class="fcx-cta"><h2>Conclusion</h2><p><b>Jet Fans Manufacturers in Delhi</b> provide ventilation solutions for basement car parks, tunnels, smoke-control systems, and other enclosed areas in which effective air movement is needed. With induced and impulse configurations, compact designs, high airflow capacity, and high-temperature motor options, jet fans may be selected according to the specific requirements of a project.</p><p>FanAir India Pvt. Ltd. manufactures and supplies jet fans for Delhi and NCR projects, with technical sizing support based on airflow, pressure, and site conditions. The company also dispatches finished units to locations throughout Delhi and other parts of India.</p><a href="../contact.php" class="fcx-cta__btn" title="Contact Fan Air India">Contact Us <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></a></div></div></section>
  </div>



